     "verification_level": "ENGINEERING-EVIDENCE"
    }
   ],
   "statement": "Each 13 deg 20 min star divided into nine subs proportional to the Vimshottari years, first sub to the star lord; 249 sign-star-sub entries. The sub-sub level repeats the rule inside the sub (derived calculation)."
  },
